# Auto-generated by the Omarchy theme engine — do not edit manually.
# Template: ~/.config/omarchy/themed/o10k-ghostty.conf.tpl
# Regenerated on every theme switch; included by ~/.config/ghostty/config
# (config-file = ?"~/.local/state/omarchy/current/theme/o10k-ghostty.conf").
#
# Only theme-varying, NON-color personality lives here. Omarchy's own theme
# include owns background, foreground, and palette — emitting those here
